---
title: Privacy Policy
lastUpdated: '2026-01-15'
---
## Your data stays yours

Cardmaniacs is designed with privacy at its core. We do not collect, store, or transmit your personal data to any third-party servers.

## iCloud Sync

All synchronization happens exclusively through Apple's iCloud infrastructure. Your subscriptions, saved articles, bookmarks, and reading progress sync between your devices via your personal iCloud account. We have no access to this data.

## Local processing

All content parsing, search indexing, and organization happens locally on your device. No data leaves your device except through iCloud Sync to your own Apple account.

## Analytics

Cardmaniacs does not include any third-party analytics, tracking, or advertising SDKs.

## Contact

If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact us at privacy@cardmaniacs.app.
